&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a motivated and enthusiastic DevOps Engineer to play a critical role in building a robust and world-class technology infrastructure environment.&amp;nbsp; The successful candidate will be a team player who enjoys collaborating across the business, and a self-motivated individual who takes the initiative in ensuring the efficient operation of the firm&#39;s critical technology environment.&amp;nbsp; This role will be based in London but involves close cooperation with the US team and regular interaction with both technology experts and business users.&amp;nbsp; As a key liaison between technical teams and business users, excellent communication skills are a must. We value those who take personal ownership of tasks and display a commitment to delivering high-quality results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
